Z||000000||rodmcneill||11-21-2000||01:29 AM||||When I was detailing my latest Fiero I found a mouse nest behind the left tail light assm.Thankfully none of the wires were chewed through. The person I had bought it from had it in storage for a few years just driving it couple times a year. Is there any chance that any of the little rascals built a nest inside the muffler? Since it is that time of the year for storage and have never lived in the country myself, is protecting your vehicles from rodents a big deal? Any mouse stories out there?||||reg||4
